---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section id="plan" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-32 text-center sm:py-40">
  <h2 class="reveal font-display mx-auto max-w-2xl text-4xl leading-[1.15] sm:text-6xl">
    Next departure is <span class="italic">March</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="reveal text-muted mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md text-lg" style="--d:120ms">
    Eight seats, three destinations. Tell us which one and we will send the itinerary.
  </p>
  <a
    href="mailto:hello@guytarheroes.com?subject=Trip%20enquiry"
    class="reveal book mt-10 inline-block rounded-full px-8 py-4 text-sm font-medium"
    style="--d:240ms"
  >
    hello@guytarheroes.com
  </a>
</section>

<footer class="border-line border-t">
  <div
    class="text-muted mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-8 text-sm"
  >
    <span class="font-display tracking-[0.2em]">WANDER</span>
    <span>&copy; {year} guytarheroes.com</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .book {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    transition:
      transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      box-shadow 0.4s ease;
  }

  .book:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
</style>
